1
00:00:04,580 --> 00:00:06,570
Oh, my God, we did it!
我的天啊，我們真的那麼做了

2
00:00:06,750 --> 00:00:09,650
We just got married. Right there!
我們剛剛結婚了，就在那裡

3
00:00:10,460 --> 00:00:12,010
Is that your ring?
那是你的戒指嗎？

4
00:00:15,230 --> 00:00:17,060
We're off to a good start.
我們有個不錯的開始

5
00:00:18,230 --> 00:00:21,820
-And, you sure you're not pregnant? -Yeah. I'm sure.
-你確定你沒有懷孕？ -我很確定

6
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,800
But if you're ready to have kids we got a room upstairs.
如果你準備好要生孩子 樓上有房間

7
00:00:24,970 --> 00:00:27,870
I mean, I'll blow off this party right now. I'll do it!
我是說我會搞砸這個派對 我會那麼做的

8
00:00:36,580 --> 00:00:39,180
Okay, you guys, that ceremony was so beautiful.
好了，大伙們 婚禮非常溫馨

9
00:00:39,350 --> 00:00:43,050
Was it?! Was it perfect?! Is it too soon to see the video?!
是嗎？它很完美嗎？ 錄影帶沖洗好了嗎？

10
00:00:43,590 --> 00:00:48,890
Can we just please take a moment? Our two best friends just got married.
大家能不能安靜一分鐘？ 我們兩個好朋友剛剛結婚

11
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:53,500
We are so blessed to be able to share in this incredible joy.
我們可以跟他們分享喜悅 真的非常幸運

12
00:00:53,670 --> 00:00:56,000
That is so true.
一點都沒錯

13
00:00:56,300 --> 00:00:59,630
Mon, is it too late to switch from chicken to steak?
摩妮卡，現在把雞肉 換成牛排太晚了吧？

14
00:01:01,570 --> 00:01:06,200
I'm so happy for you guys. And you are both so lucky!
我為你們感到高興 你們太幸運了

15
00:01:06,380 --> 00:01:09,870
I mean, you both said the right names
你們叫對了彼此的名字

16
00:01:11,620 --> 00:01:13,980
And nobody was drunk.
沒有人喝醉

17
00:01:14,150 --> 00:01:15,410
Okay.
好吧

18
00:01:15,590 --> 00:01:18,250
And nobody was gay.
沒有人是同性戀

19
00:01:19,920 --> 00:01:22,360
And on your first try.
這是你們的第一次婚姻

20
00:01:25,635 --> 00:01:27,830
The One After I Do
本集播出：婚禮之後

00:01:28,635 --> 00:01:29,830
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

21
00:02:01,700 --> 00:02:05,140
Great. Great. Just give me a sec to change film.
太棒了 讓我換一下底片

22
00:02:05,300 --> 00:02:10,170
I know I'm not supposed to know, but I do and I'm so excited for you.
我知道你不希望我知道 但我知道了，我為你感到高興

23
00:02:10,340 --> 00:02:13,110
-What's going on? -Monica's pregnant.
-發生了什麼事？ -摩妮卡懷孕了

24
00:02:14,380 --> 00:02:17,750
Oh, my God. Is that why you guys had to get married?
天啊 所以你們兩個要結婚？

25
00:02:18,250 --> 00:02:22,410
-Guys, I'm not pregnant. -Oh, slow swimmers?
-聽著，我沒有懷孕 -精子游得太慢了？

26
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:27,050
What?! What do you mean? You're not pregnant?
什麼？你是什麼意思？ 你沒有懷孕？

27
00:02:27,230 --> 00:02:30,790
-You didn't tell anybody I was, did you? -No.
-你沒有告訴任何人我懷孕了吧？ -沒有

28
00:02:31,500 --> 00:02:33,490
I'll be right back.
我馬上回來

29
00:02:34,070 --> 00:02:36,760
You. Take a lot of pictures.
你，多拍一些照片

30
00:02:37,100 --> 00:02:39,800
Why don't we get a shot of Monica and the bloody soldier.
我們為什麼不拍張 摩妮卡跟英勇士兵的合照？

31
00:02:39,970 --> 00:02:42,870
About that, Joey, you have to change before the party.
關於那一點，喬伊 你得在婚宴開始前換套衣服

32
00:02:43,040 --> 00:02:46,310
-I can't. I don't have any other clothes here. -Find some, please.
-我辦不到，我沒帶衣服來換 -拜託你去找套衣服

33
00:02:46,480 --> 00:02:50,380
Anything that doesn't say, "I died tragically in France."
別再穿著 「我在法國戰死」的衣服

34
00:02:50,820 --> 00:02:53,280
-Fine! -And be careful who you hug, okay?
-好吧 -不要亂抱任何人，好嗎？

35
00:02:53,450 --> 00:02:57,850
My father's upstairs in tears because you got blood on his dress.
我爸在樓上哭得半死 因為你害他的禮服沾到了血

36
00:02:59,220 --> 00:03:02,220
Why don't we see the bride and the groom, and the bridesmaids.
我們為什麼不讓新人 跟伴娘們合照一些照片？

37
00:03:04,030 --> 00:03:07,230
Hey, Mon, why'd you tell the guys that you weren't pregnant?
摩妮卡，你為什麼告訴大家 你沒有懷孕？

38
00:03:07,400 --> 00:03:10,060
-Because I'm not. -We found your tests.
-因為我沒有懷孕 -我們發現了你的驗孕棒

39
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:11,930
If you're not pregnant..
如果你沒有懷孕…

40
00:03:16,670 --> 00:03:18,800
it's because I am.
那是因為我懷孕了

41
00:03:20,110 --> 00:03:22,200
What are you talking about?
你在胡說什麼？

42
00:03:22,380 --> 00:03:25,840
Yes, I am with child.
對，我懷了孩子

43
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:29,780
I didn't want to say anything because it's your day.
我不想說 因為今天是你們的大喜之日

44
00:03:29,950 --> 00:03:33,790
-I didn't wanna steal your thunder. -So you told people I was pregnant?
-我不想搶了你的風采 -於是你告訴大家我懷孕了？

45
00:03:34,190 --> 00:03:37,180
Does this look like a conversation I want to remember?
這是那種 我會想記住的對話嗎？

46
00:03:38,230 --> 00:03:40,320
-Who's the father? -Yeah.
-孩子的爸是誰？ -對

47
00:03:40,500 --> 00:03:42,330
I can't say.
我不能說

48
00:03:42,500 --> 00:03:43,900
-Why? -Why not?
-為什麼？ -為什麼不行？

49
00:03:44,570 --> 00:03:47,900
I can't say because he's famous.
我不能說，因為他是名人

50
00:03:48,810 --> 00:03:51,070
Oh, my God. Who is it?
天啊，他是誰？

51
00:03:52,280 --> 00:03:54,270
Phoebe, come on, you have to tell us.
菲比，你得告訴我們

52
00:03:54,450 --> 00:03:57,740
Okay, okay, it's James Brolin.
好吧，是詹姆斯布洛林

53
00:03:59,180 --> 00:04:02,020
James Brolin is the father of my baby.
詹姆斯布洛林是孩子的爸爸

54
00:04:02,220 --> 00:04:05,450
As in Barbra Streisand's husband James Brolin?
你是說芭芭拉史翠珊的老公 詹姆斯布洛林？

55
00:04:06,020 --> 00:04:07,550
What?!
什麼？

56
00:04:07,930 --> 00:04:09,920
Well, he never said that to me.
他一直都沒有告訴我

57
00:04:11,860 --> 00:04:15,230
Monica, if you step away, we'll get Chandler and the bridesmaids.
摩妮卡，請你先離開 我們要拍錢德跟伴娘的合照

58
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:17,460
How about just the bridesmaids?
何不只拍伴娘的合照呢？

59
00:04:17,640 --> 00:04:20,100
I am the groom. I was told it was a big deal.
我是伴郎 聽說這個位置很重要

60
00:04:20,270 --> 00:04:22,070
-It is. -Yeah.
-沒錯 -對

61
00:04:24,210 --> 00:04:25,470
Oh, my God.
天啊

62
00:04:25,640 --> 00:04:28,510
Thank you for that. I can't deal with the stress quite yet.
謝謝你 我還沒有辦法承受那樣的壓力

63
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:30,550
Instead you told me Monica was pregnant?
於是你告訴我 摩妮卡懷孕了？

64
00:04:30,720 --> 00:04:33,340
You said she was. I didn't disagree with you.
是你說她懷孕了 我沒有反駁你

65
00:04:33,520 --> 00:04:35,010
Sneaky.
很狡猾吧

66
00:04:35,690 --> 00:04:37,380
Smile, ladies!
笑一個，小姐們

67
00:04:38,490 --> 00:04:41,820
-By the way, James Brolin? -I know.
-對了，詹姆斯布洛林？ -我知道

68
00:04:41,990 --> 00:04:45,900
I could only think of two names: him and Ed Begley Jr.
我腦海裡浮起兩個人名 他跟小艾德貝格利

69
00:04:46,970 --> 00:04:52,200
-Then I remembered he's gay, so.. -Ed Begley Jr. is not gay.
-然後我想起來他是男同志，所以… -小艾德貝格利不是男同志

70
00:04:52,370 --> 00:04:53,800
Really?
真的嗎？

71
00:04:57,280 --> 00:04:59,180
Congratulations!
恭喜

72
00:04:59,340 --> 00:05:02,180
Look who's married! And just in time too, I hear.
看看誰結婚了 我聽說你們是奉子成婚

73
00:05:02,350 --> 00:05:03,680
What? Ross!
什麼？羅斯

74
00:05:05,620 --> 00:05:09,780
So if you've got this all under control, I'm just gonna..
如果你不去好好解釋 我會…

75
00:05:11,490 --> 00:05:14,860
I just wanted you to know that you have made us happier
我只是要你知道 你讓我們更快樂了

76
00:05:15,030 --> 00:05:17,190
You have given us more joy..
你讓我們更加高興…

77
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:19,060
I'm not pregnant.
我沒有懷孕

78
00:05:19,230 --> 00:05:20,530
What?
什麼？

79
00:05:22,170 --> 00:05:24,000
I'm not pregnant.
我沒有懷孕

80
00:05:25,840 --> 00:05:27,200
Oh, well.
好吧

81
00:05:28,110 --> 00:05:30,600
But I did still get married today.
但我今天還是結婚了

82
00:05:30,780 --> 00:05:32,440
Whatever.
隨便

83
00:05:43,820 --> 00:05:45,480
Thank you very much.
謝謝

84
00:05:45,660 --> 00:05:49,680
Ladies and gentlemen, it gives me great pleasure to introduce to you:
各位先生女士 我很榮幸跟大家介紹

85
00:05:49,860 --> 00:05:52,460
Mr. and Mrs. Chandler Bing.
錢德賓夫婦

86
00:05:58,370 --> 00:06:03,400
-Before we go out there, I got a present. -I'm not gonna put my hand in your pocket.
-到舞池前我要送你一份禮物 -我不想把手伸到你的口袋裡

87
00:06:03,570 --> 00:06:07,070
-No. I've been taking dancing lessons. -What?
-不，我去上了舞蹈課 -什麼？

88
00:06:07,250 --> 00:06:11,310
For the last six weeks. I wanted this to be a moment you'd never forget.
我上了六星期的舞蹈課 我希望這一刻能讓你永生難忘

89
00:06:11,480 --> 00:06:13,070
That is so sweet.
那真的是太體貼了

90
00:06:13,250 --> 00:06:16,650
So would you care to join me in our first dance as husband and wife?
你願不願意以夫妻的身份 跟我跳第一隻舞？

91
00:06:16,820 --> 00:06:18,120
Yes.
我願意

92
00:06:22,730 --> 00:06:26,530
-What's the matter? -It's these new shoes, they're all slippery.
-怎麼了？ -我的新鞋太滑了

93
00:06:26,700 --> 00:06:29,430
-Are you gonna be able to do this? -Not well.
-你能跳舞嗎？ -不太行

94
00:06:36,340 --> 00:06:39,740
Well, the good news is, I don't think anyone's looking at us.
好消息是 我想沒有人在看我們

95
00:06:40,710 --> 00:06:43,480
So are you ready to talk about it?
你準備要談了嗎？

96
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:45,550
No.
不

97
00:06:46,980 --> 00:06:48,470
Now?
現在呢？

98
00:06:49,890 --> 00:06:51,220
No!
不

99
00:06:51,590 --> 00:06:54,250
-We'll talk about something else then. -Thank you.
-我們來談別的事 -謝謝

100
00:06:54,430 --> 00:06:56,360
Who's the father?
孩子的爸是誰？

101
00:06:56,760 --> 00:06:58,730
Honey, I haven't told him yet..
甜心，我還沒有告訴他…

102
00:06:58,900 --> 00:07:02,700
so, until I do, I don't think I should tell anybody else.
我打算先告訴他 再告訴其他人

103
00:07:02,870 --> 00:07:04,960
That's fine. That's fair.
沒關係，那很公平

104
00:07:05,170 --> 00:07:07,260
-Is it Tag? -Phoebe!
-是泰格嗎？ -菲比

105
00:07:07,440 --> 00:07:09,630
Okay, I'm sorry. I'll stop.
好吧，對不起，我不說了

106
00:07:09,810 --> 00:07:11,470
Is it Ross? It's Ross, isn't it?
是羅斯嗎？是羅斯吧？

107
00:07:11,640 --> 00:07:14,580
-Oh, my God, it's Joey! -Stop it. Okay?
-天啊，是喬伊 -別說了，好嗎？

108
00:07:14,750 --> 00:07:17,480
I am not gonna tell you until I tell him.
在告訴他之前 我不會告訴你的

109
00:07:17,650 --> 00:07:19,710
At least we know it's a him.
至少我們知道他是個男的

110
00:07:26,060 --> 00:07:27,960
Oh, sweet Lord.
天啊

111
00:07:28,130 --> 00:07:30,530
I'm sorry, okay? I went down to the gift shop.
對不起，好嗎？ 我跑到禮品店

112
00:07:30,700 --> 00:07:33,890
It was either this or a bathrobe. What's more important:
那裡只賣這個跟浴袍 什麼事比較重要呢？

113
00:07:34,070 --> 00:07:36,560
The way I'm dressed, or being with you today?
我的穿著打扮 還是我今天能夠出席？

114
00:07:36,730 --> 00:07:40,400
Honey, I'm not gonna even pretend I was listening. Hey! Hey!
我不會假裝 我聽到你說什麼

115
00:07:48,010 --> 00:07:51,540
I'm Ross, I don't believe we met. I'm Monica's older brother.
我是羅斯，我相信我們沒有見過 我是摩妮卡的哥哥

116
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:54,840
Hi, I'm Mona from her restaurant.
我是她在餐廳的同事蒙娜

117
00:07:55,720 --> 00:07:58,750
Hello, Mona from her restaurant.
你好，她在餐廳的同事蒙娜

118
00:08:03,330 --> 00:08:05,890
Mona. What a beautiful name.
蒙娜，這個名字很美

119
00:08:06,060 --> 00:08:08,830
You think so? I always kind of hated it.
你真的那麼想？ 我一直都很討厭這個名字

120
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:11,260
Come on! Mona Lisa.
少來了，蒙娜麗莎

121
00:08:11,440 --> 00:08:12,900
Mona...
蒙娜…

122
00:08:14,210 --> 00:08:15,640
Llegglachen.
利格拉齊

123
00:08:16,740 --> 00:08:19,010
The famous botanist.
她是著名的植物學家

124
00:08:19,510 --> 00:08:23,170
Oh, no, she's.. Well, she's dead now, but..
不，她… 她死了，但是…

125
00:08:23,610 --> 00:08:28,280
Supposedly she was once quite the hottie of the plant world.
她曾經是植物學界 最性感的女人

126
00:08:28,450 --> 00:08:29,710
Really?
真的嗎？

127
00:08:29,890 --> 00:08:34,020
-See, I never knew about her. -Linda Llegglachen..
-我根本不認識她 -琳達利格拉齊…

128
00:08:38,160 --> 00:08:40,460
So, what table are you at?
你在幾號桌？

129
00:08:42,470 --> 00:08:43,760
Me too.
我也是

130
00:08:43,940 --> 00:08:46,900
Good. Now there'll be someone there who likes my name.
很好，那麼有個喜歡我名字的人 會跟我同桌

131
00:08:47,070 --> 00:08:48,900
Yes, there will.
對，沒錯

132
00:08:55,580 --> 00:09:00,880
Guess what, Molly Gilbert. You've just been bumped up to table one.
猜怎麼了？茉莉吉柏特 你剛剛被踢到一號桌

133
00:09:01,050 --> 00:09:05,750
And if it's all right with you, I'll take your place at table six.
如果你沒有意見的話 我要代替你坐到六號桌

134
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:08,360
Martin Llegglachen.
馬丁利格拉齊

135
00:09:09,930 --> 00:09:14,160
That's better. Now, just bend your arms a little bit. Now look straight ahead.
那樣子好多了，現在雙手彎曲 眼睛看前方

136
00:09:14,330 --> 00:09:17,770
This time I want you to really put your ass into it.
這次我要你 臀部用力頂

137
00:09:22,140 --> 00:09:24,510
Who's slippery now?
看你還滑不滑？

138
00:09:25,380 --> 00:09:30,250
Isn't that just the best feeling? Rubbing a fork on the bottom of your shoe?
那真的很棒吧？ 拿叉子去磨你的鞋底？

139
00:09:31,450 --> 00:09:35,110
Chandler, darling, look, my date has finally arrived.
錢德，你看 我的男伴終於來了

140
00:09:35,290 --> 00:09:40,050
I'd like you to meet Dennis Phillips. Dennis, this is my son, Chandler.
我要你見見丹尼斯菲利浦斯 丹尼斯，他是我兒子錢德

141
00:09:40,220 --> 00:09:42,560
-Congratulations. -Thank you.
-恭喜 -謝謝

142
00:09:42,730 --> 00:09:44,920
Dennis is a dear old friend..
丹尼斯是我的老朋友…

143
00:09:45,100 --> 00:09:48,070
and a fantastic lover.
跟好情人

144
00:09:49,970 --> 00:09:52,160
Are my ears bleeding?
我的耳朵在流血嗎？

145
00:09:53,470 --> 00:09:57,410
Don't mind Chandler. He's always been shy.
別理錢德 他一向都很害羞

146
00:09:57,580 --> 00:09:58,870
Oh, you're right.
你說的對

147
00:09:59,040 --> 00:10:02,380
Bravo, Dennis. Thanks for pleasing my mother so.
太棒了，丹尼斯 謝謝你取悅我老媽

148
00:10:03,980 --> 00:10:07,350
I'm so sorry I missed the ceremony. I was stuck at auditions.
抱歉我沒趕上婚禮 我忙著在試鏡

149
00:10:07,520 --> 00:10:10,420
Yes, Dennis is directing a new Broadway show.
對，丹尼斯正在執導 一出百老匯新戲

150
00:10:10,590 --> 00:10:12,750
I don't believe we've met. Joey Tribbiani.
我不敢相信能見到你 喬伊崔比亞尼

151
00:10:12,920 --> 00:10:15,920
-Dennis Phillips. -I've admired your work for years.
-丹尼斯菲利浦斯 -多年來我一直很仰慕你的成就

152
00:10:16,090 --> 00:10:19,090
-You've done some really amazing stuff. -Thank you.
-你真的很棒 -謝謝

153
00:10:19,260 --> 00:10:21,820
If you'll excuse me, I'm gonna go get myself a drink.
對不起 我要去喝點東西

154
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,490
I'll be back in a moment.
我馬上回來

155
00:10:26,140 --> 00:10:27,600
Okay. You stop.
好吧，別鬧了

156
00:10:30,940 --> 00:10:34,140
Dennis Phillips. That's great. How did you guys meet?
丹尼斯菲利浦斯，那真的是太棒了 你們怎麼認識的？

157
00:10:34,310 --> 00:10:38,840
-Well, it's a funny story. -Funny, "ha-ha"? Or funny:
-那是個有趣的故事 -是普通有趣還是爆笑？

158
00:10:47,530 --> 00:10:52,720
Thank you. If everyone will please take your seats, dinner will be served.
謝謝，大家請坐 晚宴馬上開始

159
00:11:04,440 --> 00:11:08,810
-I thought you were at table six. -No. Nine.
-我以為你在六號桌 -不，是九號桌

160
00:11:11,520 --> 00:11:16,750
See, before, when you showed it to me, you held it that way..
你剛剛拿給我看時 是那樣子拿的…

161
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:19,450
which was misleading.
我被你誤導了

162
00:11:30,470 --> 00:11:31,800
Hello.
哈囉

163
00:11:38,480 --> 00:11:42,710
Will you see if your mom can give my resume to Dennis Phillips?
你能請你媽把我的履歷表 拿給丹尼斯菲利浦斯嗎？

164
00:11:42,880 --> 00:11:48,220
Well, they've kind of locked themselves in one of the men's room stalls right now.
他們正把自己 鎖在男洗手間裡

165
00:11:49,420 --> 00:11:51,510
Perhaps when they get out.
或許等他們出來再說

166
00:11:52,020 --> 00:11:55,320
If I could get in a Broadway show, then I would've done it all.
只要能演百老匯舞台劇 我什麼戲都能演

167
00:11:55,490 --> 00:11:57,290
Film, television and theater.
電影，電視劇跟舞台劇

168
00:11:57,460 --> 00:12:00,920
The only thing left would be radio. But that's just for ugly people.
唯一例外是廣播劇 因為那是給醜八怪演的

169
00:12:02,370 --> 00:12:05,700
-What size shoes do you wear? -Eleven,11.
-你穿幾號鞋？ -11，11號半

170
00:12:05,870 --> 00:12:09,830
My shoes give me a problem on the dance floor. Can I borrow your boots?
我的鞋子太滑沒辦法跳舞 你的戲靴能借我嗎？

171
00:12:10,010 --> 00:12:13,070
I don't really even know where I left those.
我真的不知道 我把靴子丟到哪裡去了

172
00:12:15,110 --> 00:12:19,010
-Those aren't 11 . -Okay, fine, I'm a 7!
-你的腳不可能是11號半 -好吧，我穿七號的鞋子

173
00:12:19,180 --> 00:12:23,520
I have surprisingly small feet. But the rest of me is good. I'll show you.
我的腳非常小 但其他部份都很大，我可以露給你看

174
00:12:27,320 --> 00:12:30,020
Who am I kidding? I belong in radio.
我在跟誰開玩笑呢？ 我應該去演廣播劇

175
00:12:33,600 --> 00:12:38,160
-Can you believe Phoebe got pregnant? -Let's not talk about that right now.
-你能相信菲比懷孕了嗎？ -現在別談那件事

176
00:12:38,440 --> 00:12:42,270
-This is so huge. -Sure, but as big as your wedding?
-這是大消息 -沒錯，但它沒有你的婚禮重要

177
00:12:42,440 --> 00:12:44,870
Of course not. Nothing is.
當然，我的婚禮是最重要的

178
00:12:46,280 --> 00:12:48,640
Between me and you, in this day and age..
這是我們私下的談話 到了這個時代…

179
00:12:48,810 --> 00:12:51,180
how dumb do you have to be to get pregnant?
誰會笨到 讓自己懷孕？

180
00:12:51,350 --> 00:12:55,680
Sometimes you can do everything right. Everyone wears what they're supposed to..
有時候你該做的都做了 大家都戴上他們該戴的東西…

181
00:12:55,850 --> 00:12:58,620
and one of those little guys just gets through.
但有個小傢伙 還是攻過了城池

182
00:12:59,490 --> 00:13:02,930
-How? -I don't know. Maybe they have tools.
-怎麼會呢？ -我不知道，或許它們有工具

183
00:13:04,230 --> 00:13:07,660
Well, I talked to her, and she's definitely gonna have the baby.
我跟她談過 她想留下孩子

184
00:13:07,830 --> 00:13:10,700
She said she's gonna raise it on her own.
她說 她要自己撫養孩子

185
00:13:11,240 --> 00:13:14,360
-Well, maybe that's really brave. -Maybe.
-或許那真的很勇敢 -或許吧

186
00:13:14,540 --> 00:13:17,840
I just hope she realizes how hard it's gonna be.
我只是希望 她知道那有多辛苦

187
00:13:19,580 --> 00:13:23,600
Maybe she hasn't really thought it through that much.
或許她沒有 想那麼多

188
00:13:23,950 --> 00:13:26,010
Well, there's a lot to think about.
的確有很多事需要考慮

189
00:13:26,180 --> 00:13:31,490
How is she gonna handle this financially? How is she gonna juggle work?
她要怎麼處理經濟問題？ 她怎麼有辦法去工作？

190
00:13:31,660 --> 00:13:36,720
Does she realize she's not gonna have a date again for the next, like,18 years?
她知道她在未來的18年內 都無法再去約會了嗎？

191
00:13:39,830 --> 00:13:41,560
I don't know.
我不知道

192
00:13:43,500 --> 00:13:45,030
Are you okay?
你沒事吧？

193
00:13:46,870 --> 00:13:51,240
I'm just thinking about Phoebe. Poor, knocked-up Phoebe.
我只是想到了菲比 懷了孕的可憐菲比

194
00:13:52,380 --> 00:13:55,400
-Champagne? -Oh, yes! Thank you very much.
-要喝香檳嗎？ -好的，謝謝你

195
00:14:09,260 --> 00:14:12,390
That's actually how the French drink it.
法國人都是那樣喝香檳的

196
00:14:16,130 --> 00:14:21,000
Well, I just got off the phone with my lover James Brolin.
我剛剛跟我的情人 詹姆斯布洛林通過電話

197
00:14:22,370 --> 00:14:26,280
-Oh, really? -Apparently, he is married to some singer.
-真的嗎？ -很明顯地他娶了一個歌手

198
00:14:28,410 --> 00:14:33,150
But he said he'd leave her for me. And I said, "James Brolin, are you sure?"
但他說他會為了我離開她 我說「詹姆斯布洛林，你確定嗎？」

199
00:14:33,450 --> 00:14:36,180
-James Brolin said.. -Rachel's the one who's pregnant?
-詹姆斯布洛林說… -懷孕的人是瑞秋？

200
00:14:36,350 --> 00:14:37,950
What?!
什麼？

201
00:14:39,960 --> 00:14:41,650
Why bother?
幹嘛那麼麻煩呢？

202
00:14:43,290 --> 00:14:45,630
-How do you feel? -I don't know how I feel.
-你覺得如何？ -我不知道我有什麼感覺

203
00:14:45,800 --> 00:14:50,460
This is all happening so fast. I have to make all these decisions that I don't wanna make.
一切發生的太快 我得做出這些我不想做的決定

204
00:14:50,940 --> 00:14:53,100
Someone just take this away from me!
快把這玩意拿走

205
00:14:53,270 --> 00:14:56,830
-Calm down. Maybe you're not pregnant. -What?!
-冷靜點，或許你沒有懷孕 -什麼？

206
00:14:57,010 --> 00:15:01,170
When I got pregnant with the triplets, I took that test, like, three times.
我懷三胞胎時 也驗了三次孕才確定

207
00:15:01,350 --> 00:15:06,110
Yes. Maybe it's a false positive. Are you sure you peed on the stick right?
對，或許是假警報 你確定你尿在驗孕棒的方式沒錯？

208
00:15:06,450 --> 00:15:08,380
How many ways are there to do that?
不然我要怎麼尿才對？

209
00:15:09,250 --> 00:15:13,520
I'm just saying, don't freak out until you're 100 percent sure.
我是說沒有百分之百確定前 別大驚小怪

210
00:15:14,060 --> 00:15:17,320
All right, I'll take it again when I get home.
好吧 我回家後會再驗一次

211
00:15:17,630 --> 00:15:19,600
I can wait until then.
我可以等到那時候再說

212
00:15:21,170 --> 00:15:24,970
Oh, this is such a good party. How late does it go till?
這個派對很棒 它什麼時候會結束？

213
00:15:25,740 --> 00:15:29,140
-You gotta take it now. -No, this your wedding.
-你可以現在驗 -不，這是你的婚禮

214
00:15:29,310 --> 00:15:33,680
You're not gonna be able to have fun until we know. Do it as a present to me.
沒有確定前你根本無法盡興地玩 就把它當成送我的禮物吧

215
00:15:34,680 --> 00:15:36,010
Okay, thank you.
好吧，謝謝你

216
00:15:36,180 --> 00:15:39,340
-I'll run out and get you one. -You girls are so great.
-我去幫你買驗孕棒 -你們真的是太好了

217
00:15:39,520 --> 00:15:42,920
-Wait a minute. Who's the father? -She won't tell us.
-等一下，孩子的爸是誰？ -她不肯告訴我們

218
00:15:43,090 --> 00:15:45,950
Come on! It's my wedding. That could be my present!
快說吧，這是我的婚禮 你可以當做是送我的禮物

219
00:15:46,120 --> 00:15:51,120
-I just gave you peeing on a stick. -See, this is why you register.
-我剛剛答應為了你驗孕 -看吧，所以一定要有禮物清單

220
00:15:57,840 --> 00:16:01,400
It was the chair again. Okay? I'm not doing it!
又是椅子的聲音，好嗎？ 不是我幹的

221
00:16:03,140 --> 00:16:05,840
Dad. Can't you go back to your table?
老爹，你不能回你的桌子去嗎？

222
00:16:06,210 --> 00:16:12,580
No. Apparently little Molly Gilbert is enjoying her grown-up salmon en croute.
不，很明顯地小茉莉吉柏特 正開心地吃她的大號鮭魚開胃菜

223
00:16:22,530 --> 00:16:24,620
Look, I don't.. You know what?
聽著，我沒有… 你知道嗎？

224
00:16:30,900 --> 00:16:33,060
-Would you like to dance? -Sure.
-你想跳舞嗎？ -好啊

225
00:16:33,240 --> 00:16:34,640
Great.
太棒了

226
00:16:35,940 --> 00:16:38,870
-Dr. Geller. -I wasn't farting!
-蓋勒博士 -我沒有放屁

227
00:16:42,280 --> 00:16:44,870
A little game from our table.
那是我們那一桌玩的小遊戲

228
00:16:46,720 --> 00:16:48,840
Dr. Geller, will you dance with me?
蓋勒博士，你願意跟我跳舞嗎？

229
00:16:51,590 --> 00:16:55,550
Maybe later. Right now, I'm about to dance with this lady.
或許待會再說 現在我要跟這位小姐跳舞

230
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:04,990
Unless this lady wouldn't mind letting you go first.
除非這位小姐不介意 讓你插隊

231
00:17:05,170 --> 00:17:08,000
I'd be happy to. You are very sweet.
我很樂意 你太好心了

232
00:17:09,410 --> 00:17:11,200
Yes, I am.
沒錯

233
00:17:12,440 --> 00:17:16,500
In fact, let's try my special way. You can dance on my feet.
事實上我們來試試我的絕招 你可以踩在我的腳上跳舞

234
00:17:16,680 --> 00:17:19,080
-Sure. -Yeah? Hop on.
-沒問題 -是嗎？跳上來吧

235
00:17:23,750 --> 00:17:27,750
Is the pretty lady looking? Keep dancing.
那個美麗的小姐在看嗎？ 繼續跳

236
00:17:39,500 --> 00:17:41,900
And the world will never know.
誰想得到呢？

237
00:17:43,470 --> 00:17:45,810
Did you talk to Dennis about me yet?
你跟丹尼斯提過我的事了嗎？

238
00:17:45,980 --> 00:17:49,640
I told him how talented you were and all about Days of our Lives.
我跟他提到你非常有天份 還有《我們的日子》的事

239
00:17:49,810 --> 00:17:54,180
You don't tell a Broadway guy that! Now he thinks I'm just a soap actor.
你不能告訴百老匯導演那種事 現在他會以為我是肥皂劇演員

240
00:17:54,350 --> 00:17:56,440
But you're not just a soap actor.
但你不只是肥皂劇演員

241
00:17:56,620 --> 00:18:00,280
You are a soap actor with freakishly tiny feet.
你是有雙小腳的 肥皂劇演員

242
00:18:02,330 --> 00:18:06,190
He has no idea what kind of range I have.
他不知道 我有多厲害

243
00:18:07,260 --> 00:18:08,730
Don't move.
別動

244
00:18:10,930 --> 00:18:13,990
It's like he's running on tiny little pegs.
那像是他用 小腳在跑步

245
00:18:20,610 --> 00:18:22,940
-Thank you. -No, thank you, Miranda.
-謝謝 -不，謝謝你，米蘭達

246
00:18:23,110 --> 00:18:24,670
-Melinda. -All right.
-是梅玲達 -好吧

247
00:18:25,950 --> 00:18:30,820
-How cute was that? -Oh, were you watching?
-那真的好可愛 -你在看我們嗎？

248
00:18:32,020 --> 00:18:33,990
Can I go next?
下一個是我嗎？

249
00:18:35,130 --> 00:18:37,890
Of course you can. Hop on.
當然是，來吧

250
00:18:38,060 --> 00:18:41,050
Okay, but I get to hop on after her.
好吧，但我要排在她後面

251
00:18:47,910 --> 00:18:50,770
-I am so gonna score. -What?
-我一定能得分 -什麼？

252
00:18:50,940 --> 00:18:53,210
I like your bow.
我喜歡你的蝴蝶結

253
00:18:58,380 --> 00:19:02,910
I'd like to propose a toast to Monica and Chandler..
我要請大家舉杯 向摩妮卡及錢德致意…

254
00:19:03,090 --> 00:19:07,420
the greatest couple in the world, and my best friends.
他們是全世界最速配的夫妻 也是我最好的朋友

255
00:19:07,590 --> 00:19:12,390
When I first found out they were getting married, I was a little angry.
我剛聽說他們要結婚時 我非常生氣

256
00:19:12,560 --> 00:19:17,690
I was like, "Why, God? Why? How can you take them away from me!"
我心想「天啊，為什麼？ 你為什麼要把他們從我身邊搶走？」

257
00:19:19,500 --> 00:19:25,270
But then I thought back over all our memories together. Some happy memories.
然後我回想起我們之間所有的回憶 快樂的回憶

258
00:19:28,050 --> 00:19:31,450
And there were some sad memories.
跟悲傷的回憶

259
00:19:34,850 --> 00:19:36,480
I'm sorry.
對不起

260
00:19:37,150 --> 00:19:39,710
And some scared memories.
可怕的回憶

261
00:19:46,130 --> 00:19:50,860
And then I realized I'll always be their friend.
然後我瞭解到 我永遠都會是他們的朋友

262
00:19:51,030 --> 00:19:54,730
Their friend who can speak in many dialects..
他們的朋友 能說許多台詞…

263
00:19:54,910 --> 00:19:59,570
and has training in stage combat and is willing to do partial nudity.
接受過舞台打鬥訓練 願意拍部份裸露的戲

264
00:20:01,780 --> 00:20:03,110
To the happy couple.
敬這對金童玉女

265
00:20:10,090 --> 00:20:12,950
-Thank you. -That was very nice, Ashley.
-謝謝 -那真的是太棒了，艾許莉

266
00:20:13,120 --> 00:20:15,220
-Can we do it again? -No, no.
-我們能再跳一次嗎？ -不

267
00:20:16,430 --> 00:20:20,390
-So, is it my turn now? -I'm next.
-現在輪到我了嗎？ -我是下一個

268
00:20:23,830 --> 00:20:27,790
-That's okay, you can dance with her first. -Are you sure?
-沒關係，你可以先跟她跳 -你確定？

269
00:20:30,610 --> 00:20:32,840
-So, what's your name? -Gert.
-你叫什麼名字？ -葛特

270
00:20:33,010 --> 00:20:35,040
That's pretty.
那個名字很美

271
00:20:41,590 --> 00:20:44,150
What are you doing there, Gert?
你在做什麼？葛特

272
00:20:45,060 --> 00:20:48,790
Dancing on your feet like the other girls did it.
跟其他女孩一樣 踩在你腳上跳舞

273
00:20:50,532 --> 00:20:51,829
好吧

274
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:54,760
Hop on, Gert.
跳上來吧，葛特

275
00:20:59,400 --> 00:21:03,170
-Why aren't you moving your feet? -I'm trying.
-你的腳為什麼不動？ -我在努力了

276
00:21:04,980 --> 00:21:08,040
Faster. You're not going fast enough.
快一點，你跳的太慢了

277
00:21:08,210 --> 00:21:10,940
Maybe I should stand on your feet!
或許我該踩在你腳上

278
00:21:15,520 --> 00:21:19,180
So did you happen to catch my toast up there?
你有聽到 我的致詞了嗎？

279
00:21:19,360 --> 00:21:24,190
-Oh, my God. That was for my benefit? -There was a little something for everyone.
-天啊，你那麼做是為了我？ -我那麼做是為了所有人

280
00:21:24,360 --> 00:21:29,820
-I know you're casting for this new show. -I don't think you're right for this project.
-我知道你在為新戲選角 -我想你不適合這個計劃

281
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:31,560
You're wrong.
你錯了

282
00:21:31,740 --> 00:21:35,600
Whatever it is, I can do it. If you didn't see it up there, just try me.
不論內容是什麼，我都辦得到 如果你對剛剛的表演不滿意，考考我

283
00:21:35,770 --> 00:21:39,900
It's an all Chinese cast. Can you be Chinese?
那齣戲的演員全是中國人 你可以變成中國人嗎？

284
00:21:42,010 --> 00:21:46,750
-Well, I'm not proud of this, but.. -Oh, my God. Please don't!
-我不以此為榮，但是… -天啊，求求你別那麼做

285
00:21:48,950 --> 00:21:53,010
-Ready to get back to the dance floor? -Did it turn into sand?
-準備重回舞池了嗎？ -它變成沙地了嗎？

286
00:21:53,190 --> 00:21:58,590
-Come on, I love this song. You'll be fine. -No. No, I won't.
-我喜歡這首歌，你會跳得很好的 -不，我不會的

287
00:21:59,030 --> 00:22:01,500
Do you know why I took all those lessons?
你知道為什麼 我要去上舞蹈課嗎？

288
00:22:01,670 --> 00:22:06,300
I didn't want you to be embarrassed to be seen on the dance floor..
我不希望你被看到 跟一個笨拙的白癡跳舞…

289
00:22:06,470 --> 00:22:07,940
with some clumsy idiot.
丟光了臉

290
00:22:08,110 --> 00:22:11,040
Oh, sweetie, you could never embarrass me.
甜心 你不可能讓我出糗

291
00:22:11,210 --> 00:22:15,800
Okay, you could easily embarrass me. But it doesn't matter, all right?
好吧，你很容易就會讓我出糗 但那不重要，好嗎？

292
00:22:15,980 --> 00:22:17,540
I married you.
我嫁給你

293
00:22:17,710 --> 00:22:20,980
No matter what you do, I'm gonna come home with you, okay?
不論你做什麼 我會跟你回家，好嗎？

294
00:22:21,150 --> 00:22:24,310
So I'm gonna dance on my wedding night with my husband. Come on.
我要在新婚之夜 跟我丈夫跳舞，來吧

295
00:22:24,490 --> 00:22:29,450
But I'll tell you, that's the last time I buy shoes at the Slippery Fun Shoe store.
但我告訴你，那是我最後一次 在"超滑鞋店"買鞋子

296
00:22:31,560 --> 00:22:34,360
Just try not to move your feet at all.
盡量不要移動你的腳

297
00:22:41,170 --> 00:22:43,230
There you go.
就是那樣

298
00:22:45,210 --> 00:22:47,730
-I'm gonna have you arrested. -Why?
-我要逮捕你 -為什麼？

299
00:22:47,910 --> 00:22:49,440
You stole my moves!
你偷走了我的舞步

300
00:22:53,580 --> 00:22:56,210
Oh, Chandler, you're quite the dancer!
錢德，你是跳舞高手

301
00:22:57,020 --> 00:23:00,580
-Thanks, Mrs. Geller. -Oh, come on, you can call me Mom.
