306
00:23:25,380 --> 00:23:27,040
Thirty seconds, okay..
30秒，好吧…

307
00:23:27,220 --> 00:23:29,010
Did I miss it?
我錯過了嗎？

308
00:23:34,890 --> 00:23:39,690
I want you to know that if it's positive, we're gonna..
我要你知道如果是陽性反應 我們得…

309
00:23:39,860 --> 00:23:42,760
-I know. I know. -You do. Okay.
-我知道 -你知道，好吧

310
00:23:45,270 --> 00:23:46,900
It's time.
時候到了

311
00:23:47,976 --> 00:23:49,671
不准進來

