Wait. You know what? I can't look at it. Somebody else tell me.
等一下，知道嗎？我不敢看 誰幫我看一下

314
00:24:04,650 --> 00:24:05,950
It's negative.
是陰性反應

315
00:24:07,790 --> 00:24:10,420
-What? -It's negative.
-什麼？ -是陰性反應

316
00:24:18,900 --> 00:24:20,930
Well, there you go.
真相揭曉

317
00:24:26,510 --> 00:24:30,170
That is.. That's great. That is really great, great news.
那…那真的是太棒了 這真是個天大的好消息

318
00:24:34,080 --> 00:24:36,520
You know, because the whole..
因為這整件事…

319
00:24:37,890 --> 00:24:41,920
not being ready and, kind of, the financial aspects, all that..
在經濟方面我還沒有準備好 所以…

320
00:24:44,390 --> 00:24:48,590
This is so just the way that this was supposed to be.
事情本來就應該 是這樣的

321
00:24:52,300 --> 00:24:53,960
Then, great.
那麼說的話，太棒了

322
00:24:57,370 --> 00:25:00,100
God, this is so stupid.
天啊，這真的是太愚蠢了

323
00:25:02,410 --> 00:25:05,900
How can I be upset over something I never had?
我怎麼會為了 我從來沒有擁有過的東西難過？

324
00:25:06,650 --> 00:25:10,520
-It's negative? -No, it's positive.
-是陰性反應嗎？ -不，是陽性反應

325
00:25:15,930 --> 00:25:19,590
-What? -It's not negative, it's positive.
-什麼？ -不是陰性反應，是陽性反應

326
00:25:20,830 --> 00:25:24,200
-Are you sure? -Yeah, I lied before.
-你確定？ -對，剛剛我說謊

327
00:25:28,140 --> 00:25:33,040
-Now you know how you really feel about it. -That's a risky little game.
-現在你知道你真正的感覺了 -那是個危險的小把戲

328
00:25:36,280 --> 00:25:38,650
Are you really gonna do this?
你真的要這麼做？

329
00:25:40,120 --> 00:25:41,520
Yeah.
對

330
00:25:41,690 --> 00:25:43,620
I'm gonna have a baby.
我要生下孩子

331
00:25:44,720 --> 00:25:46,810
I'm gonna have a baby.
我要生下孩子

332
00:25:46,990 --> 00:25:49,020
I'm gonna have a baby!
我要生下孩子

333
