-With who? -No, it's still not the time.
-孩子的爸是誰？ -不，現在還不是時候

334
00:26:06,680 --> 00:26:09,840
I just didn't see the fast song coming.
我不知道接下來是快歌

335
00:26:10,010 --> 00:26:14,110
Don't talk, we'll get you up to your room, soak your feet. You'll be okay.
別說話，我們送你回房間 讓你泡泡腳，你會沒事的

336
00:26:14,280 --> 00:26:16,950
-Thank you. -That is so sweet!
-謝謝 -那真的是太好心了

337
00:26:17,120 --> 00:26:20,780
No, I mean it. There are so few genuinely nice guys out there.
不，我是認真了 現在好男人不多了

338
00:26:20,960 --> 00:26:24,830
Tell me about it. I feel like I'm holding down the fort by myself.
你說的對 我覺得自己像是死守碉堡的士兵

339
00:26:25,760 --> 00:26:28,290
-It's Joey, right? -Yeah.
-你是喬伊，對吧？ -對

340
00:26:28,470 --> 00:26:30,230
Wait a minute! No!
等一下，不

341
00:26:30,400 --> 00:26:31,960
I'm the nice one!
我才是好人

342
00:26:32,140 --> 00:26:36,400
I'm the one that danced with the kids all night. I..
是我整晚跟孩子們跳舞 我…

